ion 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nPatrick is a passionate soccer player on his high school team. For the whole year, he has been practicing hard to win the championship. On the final day of the match, his leg gets injured. Yet, he still decides to finish the game. Surprisingly, Patrick scored the final goal, leading the team to victory. However, after the match, he found out that his injury needed numerous weeks of medical rest.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Patrick ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Gratitude & Guilt\nB) Hopeless & Guilt\nC) Pride & Hopeless\nD) Sentimental & Guilt\nE) Pride & Sentimental\nF) Pride & Nervousness\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Patrick feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) He is the best player in the team & His team won the championship without him\nB) His injury is not severe & He cannot pursue his passion for playing soccer for a long time\nC) He managed to help his team win while being injure & He cannot pursue his passion for playing soccer for a long time\nD) He finished the match although he was injured & He cannot score another goal in the match\nE) He finished the match although he was injured & His team won the championship without him\nF) He is the best player in the team & He cannot pursue his passion for playing soccer for a long time","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.010981300521209453,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7ba9aa9dc5a833da079","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484154849,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:49:14","delF